# SPA fallback. Routing is client-side (wouter), so the static host must serve
# index.html for any path it has no file for — otherwise deep links like
# /profile or /itinerary 404 on reload or when shared.
#
# The 200 (rewrite, not redirect) matters: the URL stays as typed so wouter can
# read it. A 301/302 to / would drop the route.
#
# Understood by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify. Vercel ignores this file and needs
# a rewrite in vercel.json instead.
/*  /index.html  200
